# Post-merge: sync main

When the user says a PR is **merged** (or equivalent: “merged”, “PR merged”,
“it’s merged”), immediately:

1. `git checkout main`
2. `git pull` (fast-forward to `origin/main`)
3. Confirm with a short status (branch name + latest commit)

Do this without waiting to be asked to “go to main” or “pull”. Do not delete
the feature branch unless the user asks.
